// error: `%u` is not a format conversion: integers are signed, so `%d` writes every one
// error: `%z` is not a format conversion: the conversions are `d`, `i`, `x`, `X`, `o`, `b`, `f`, `e`, `g`, `E`, `G`, `c`, `s` and `?`
// error: `%é` is not a format conversion: the conversions are `d`, `i`, `x`, `X`, `o`, `b`, `f`, `e`, `g`, `E`, `G`, `c`, `s` and `?`
// error: this format specifier has no conversion: a `%` right after a hole begins one, such as `%d` or `%s`
// error: this format specifier has no conversion: a `%` right after a hole begins one, such as `%d` or `%s`
main()
  val n = 7
  println(f"${n}%u ${n}%z ${n}%é")
  println(f"${n}%5")
  println(f"${n}%")
